      "writtenOn": "2026-04-14T05:50:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What if the objects aren\u0027t added but referenced later. It could end up causing some unpredictable behaviour. Should we instead consider failing and rebuilding the cross-ref table. In which case there are already a few CLs that work on this.\n@thestig@chromium.org wdyt, do we ignore the failures or do we have the whole bool-return path.",
