        "id": 4258968
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-04-14T13:49:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Also small suggestion, keep the {}\n\n      if (!pStartNumObj) {\n        continue;\n      }\n\n      RetainPtr\u003cconst CPDF_Number\u003e pCountObj \u003d array-\u003eGetNumberAt(i * 2 + 1);\n      if (!pCountObj) {\n        continue;\n      }\n\nAs done by most of the other if-continue loops.\n```suggestion\n    if (obj.obj_num \u003e kMaxObjectNumber) {\n      continue;\n    }\n```",
